{"seq":8,"slug":"deng-xiaoping-methodology","title":"邓小平方法论","stage":"DONE","category":"deng-xiaoping-theory","categoryLabel":"邓小平理论","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/02_deng-xiaoping-theory/08_deng-xiaoping-methodology","introMarkdown":"# 邓小平方法论 简介\n\n邓小平方法论是邓小平理论中最具实践智慧的部分，体现了一位杰出政治家在复杂局势中的思维方式与决策艺术。邓小平善于将马克思主义辩证法与中国传统智慧相融合，形成了独具特色的方法论体系，其核心特征是务实、灵活和渐进。\n\n本知识库适用于希望从方法论层面理解邓小平治国理政智慧的读者，包括领导力研究者、管理学学者、政治决策分析者，以及对实用主义思维感兴趣的各类读者。\n\n全书共分三章，从哲学基础到思维方法再到领导艺术，逐层剖析邓小平的方法论智慧。\n\n第一章**实用主义哲学**，探讨邓小平方法论的哲学根基。从实事求是的思想路线，到\"摸着石头过河\"的渐进策略，再到\"猫论\"在实际工作中的运用，揭示邓小平务实哲学的核心要义与独特魅力。\n\n第二章**辩证思维**，分析邓小平处理复杂矛盾的辩证智慧。从\"两手抓、两手都要硬\"的统筹方法，到稳定与改革之间的动态平衡，再到\"让一部分人先富起来\"的策略安排，展现邓小平驾驭矛盾、化解难题的思维方式。\n\n第三章**领导智慧**，总结邓小平在政治实践中展现的领导艺术。从关键时刻的政治勇气，到战略层面的耐心与定力，再到推动干部退休制度改革的远见卓识，呈现一位伟大政治家的领导风范与人格魅力。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先读第一章理解哲学基础，再读第二章掌握辩证方法，最后通过第三章感悟领导艺术。建议在学习过程中联系具体历史事件，将方法论与实际决策相印证，方能真正体会邓小平方法论的精妙之处。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pragmatism-philosophy","title":"实用主义哲学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/pragmatism-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"seeking-truth-from-facts","title":"实事求是","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/pragmatism-philosophy/seeking-truth-from-facts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crossing-river-by-stones","title":"摸着石头过河","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/pragmatism-philosophy/crossing-river-by-stones"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cat-theory-application","title":"猫论应用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/pragmatism-philosophy/cat-theory-application"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"dialectical-thinking","title":"辩证思维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/dialectical-thinking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-hands-both-hard","title":"两手抓两手都要硬","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/dialectical-thinking/two-hands-both-hard"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stability-reform-balance","title":"稳定与改革的平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/dialectical-thinking/stability-reform-balance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"letting-some-get-rich-first","title":"先富带后富","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/dialectical-thinking/letting-some-get-rich-first"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"leadership-wisdom","title":"领导智慧","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/leadership-wisdom","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"political-courage","title":"邓小平的政治勇气","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/leadership-wisdom/political-courage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic-patience","title":"邓小平的战略耐心","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/leadership-wisdom/strategic-patience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"retirement-reform","title":"退休制度改革与权力交接","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-methodology/leadership-wisdom/retirement-reform"}]}]}